ok: HELP lists STATE in the debug tier
ok: a request signed by another key: bad_signature
ok: a garbage signature: bad_signature
ok: a request with its pid changed after signing: bad_signature
ok: no policy entry: policy
ok: a valid STATE: the actor's rendered state
ok: the same request again: replay
ok: an expired request: expired
ok: a request valid for 2 minutes: not_after_too_far
ok: a short nonce: bad_nonce
ok: an unknown argument: bad_args
ok: STATE of a pid that is not running: dead
ok: CRASHES_FULL carries the crash message
ok: CRASHES (observe tier) still does not
ok: CRASHES_FULL once the policy drops it: policy
ok: every attempt is audited, in order
ok: audit lines name the node's key
